// MockVision engine contract, version 1, for external plugins.
//
// A plugin is an executable inside a .mvpkg package. The camera process
// launches it sandboxed, with its sockets already open, and talks to it over
// gRPC on inherited Unix sockets: the plugin serves Engine on descriptor 3,
// the camera serves Host on descriptor 4, and the engine's sockets follow
// from descriptor 5, as StartRequest.socket_fds names them. Host is
